pp_build/dsa_dashboard.js` to handle stage interactions:\n      - `data-action=\"stage-practice-next\"`\n      - `data-action=\"stage-explore-problems\"`\n      - `data-action=\"set-current-stage\"`\n   4. Append Phase 7 CSS styles to `app_build/styles.css` for 10-stage timeline, stage cards, mastery badges, milestone highlights, and progress meters.\n   5. Create Phase 7 test suite `scratch/test_dsa_phase7_roadmap.js`:\n      - Test all 10 stages exist in exact suggested order.\n      - Test completion rules (0 solved = Not Started; opening problem does NOT mark mastered; solving problems increments progress and triggers In Progress/Mastered).\n      - Test skip/jump freedom: jumping to Stage 10 or Stage 5 works without restriction.\n      - Test milestone links and \"Practice Next\" navigation.\n      - Test Kadane maximum subarray output remains 6.\n   6. Run all test suites (`test_dsa_phase7_roadmap.js`, `test_dsa_phase6_solutions.js`, `test_dsa_phase5_workspace.js`, `test_dsa_phase4.js`, `test_dsa_phase3.js`, `test_dsa_phase2.js`, `test_dsa_phase1.js`, `test_phase5.js`) to ensure 100% pass rate.\n   7. Provide complete user report with changed files, tests performed, and remaining phases.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Strictly follow the 10 suggested stages in exact sequence.\n   - Do NOT mark a topic as mastered just because a user opened a problem.\n   - Preserve existing visualizer, `engine.js`, animations, step-by-step navigation, and Kadane output = 6.\n   - Use GitHub-style markdown links with `file:///` format in responses.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 12 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1791628786466_88bc671a]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b927fe1-f9a3-4b3f-9f8a-92760e157eef/.user_uploaded/media_1791628786466_88bc671a.png\nLast Edited: 2026-10-10T10:39:48Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1791630442219_ffbef1d8]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b927fe1-f9a3-4b3f-9f8a